  "corrections": [
    "Record types 01-29, HS and TS removed: they belong to the Platinum Pool Supplemental file (prefix platmonPS), not to the Pool/Security file. The bootstrap gave both prefixes the supplemental record-type set, so silver wrote an empty parquet per stratum. Bronze 202101..202604 holds exactly HP (1 row), PS and TP (1 row) per file.",
    "PS.social_indicator opens at 2025-05: it is item 32, added by layout V2.1.5 (effective June 2025, with the May 2025 monthly data). Bronze confirms 31 pipe tokens through 2025-04 and 32 from 2025-05.",
    "PS.wa_combined_loan_to_value: dropped the extractor's 'Col4' format token; the layout table gives CLTV no Format (Numeric, max length 3).",
    "Field ordinals, types and formats re-read from the V2.1 and V2.1.5 layout PDFs; roles, present windows, key_fields, pdf_type and domains added."
  ]
